~ start
if shrine_repaired
	=> mayor_arrested

set voice_pitch = 0.25
Hatz Beakman: You like jazz?
Toby: *[wave]Roar[/wave]*
Hatz Beakman: My man.
=> END

~ mayor_arrested
Hatz Beakman: Jazz man! I heard you took down my political opponent.
Hatz Beakman: Looks like I'm a shoe-in for mayor! 
Hatz Beakman: I'm gonna be makin' some changes around here, and it's all thanks to you!
Hatz Beakman: Pterosaurs will finally get the respect they deserve.
=> END